Template: pim-mp/model
Type: select
Choices: none, cis-a2, cis-a4, cis-c2, pim-a2, pim-a4, pim-c2, pim-x2, pim-x4
Description: Select your pim-mp model:
 This will set the operational mode for pim-mp.

Template: pim-mp/cal_data_cfg
Type: select
Choices: none, WlanCalData_ext_a0.conf, WlanCalData_ext.conf, WlanCalData_ext_RD.conf
Description: Select cal_data_cfg for WiFi init:
 This selects the calibration data file used by the WLAN driver.

Template: pim-mp/txpwrlimit_cfg
Type: select
Choices: txpwrlimit_cfg_9098_a0.conf, txpwrlimit_cfg_9098_a0_low.conf, txpwrlimit_cfg_9098.conf, txpwrlimit_cfg_9098_low.conf, txpwrlimit_cfg_9098_org.conf
Description: Select txpowerlimit config for WiFi init:
 This selects the txpowerlimit hostcmd file applied after driver load.
